o-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">Meteor Crater in Arizona</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">Balanced Rock near Buhl, Idaho</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><A href=\"http://www.vla.nrao.edu/\">http://www.vla.nrao.edu/</A>&nbsp;, Nex Mexico</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">University of Chicago </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-